name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q9_2025'

question 'Before launching a new travel website, a design team sketches simple outlines showing where the header, images, and buttons will go on each page, without adding any colors or pictures yet.
What is the main purpose of this step?'

wrong 'To test how quickly the site loads online'
right 'To plan the layout and structure of each page before adding visual details'
wrong 'To decide on the final fonts and color scheme'
wrong 'To write the code that connects each page together'

allow_multiple_attempts true

